Since 2026-11-04 a data-race witness has only the thread creations and the
violation (Dartagnan read the steps of later loop iterations as contradictory
orderings and rejected; 166 against 120 confirmed over the corpus, none lost).
So no step of the racing threads appears; LAZYPO_WITNESS_FULL restores them.
